<title>UK: Rolls-Royce grants EDS 300 mln stg contract.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce grants EDS 300 mln stg contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Rolls-Royce Plc said on Monday its Industrial Power Group subsidiary had awarded U.S. firm Electronic Data Systems Corp a 10-year contract worth over 300 million stg.</p>
</text>
